From: nura-builds
Subject: [PATCH] drm/msm/mdp5: black layer mixer border colour

The layer mixer's border colour shows wherever no plane is staged: in the frames of a modeset
before the first plane commit, and while the CRTC runs with its plane off. msm never set it, and
on MSM8226 it was blue (reset or bootloader value): two blue flashes during the boot splash, and
a blue screen after DPMS games. Set it to black at mode set.
---
diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/disp/mdp5/mdp5_crtc.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/disp/mdp5/mdp5_crtc.c
index fa1285513d55..0d087aa340cc 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/disp/mdp5/mdp5_crtc.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/disp/mdp5/mdp5_crtc.c
@@ -386,6 +386,14 @@ static void mdp5_crtc_mode_set_nofb(struct drm_crtc *crtc)
 			MDP5_LM_OUT_SIZE_WIDTH(mixer_width) |
 			MDP5_LM_OUT_SIZE_HEIGHT(mode->vdisplay));
 
+	/*
+	 * A black border colour: shown where no plane is staged (a modeset before the first plane
+	 * commit, a CRTC enabled with its plane off); its reset/bootloader value was blue on
+	 * MSM8226.
+	 */
+	mdp5_write(mdp5_kms, REG_MDP5_LM_BORDER_COLOR_0(lm), 0);
+	mdp5_write(mdp5_kms, REG_MDP5_LM_BORDER_COLOR_1(lm), 0);
+
 	/* Assign mixer to LEFT side in source split mode */
 	val = mdp5_read(mdp5_kms, REG_MDP5_LM_BLEND_COLOR_OUT(lm));
 	val &= ~MDP5_LM_BLEND_COLOR_OUT_SPLIT_LEFT_RIGHT;
@@ -397,6 +405,8 @@ static void mdp5_crtc_mode_set_nofb(struct drm_crtc *crtc)
 		mdp5_write(mdp5_kms, REG_MDP5_LM_OUT_SIZE(r_lm),
 			   MDP5_LM_OUT_SIZE_WIDTH(mixer_width) |
 			   MDP5_LM_OUT_SIZE_HEIGHT(mode->vdisplay));
+		mdp5_write(mdp5_kms, REG_MDP5_LM_BORDER_COLOR_0(r_lm), 0);
+		mdp5_write(mdp5_kms, REG_MDP5_LM_BORDER_COLOR_1(r_lm), 0);
 
 		/* Assign mixer to RIGHT side in source split mode */
 		val = mdp5_read(mdp5_kms, REG_MDP5_LM_BLEND_COLOR_OUT(r_lm));
